AIN TAIN\nhttps://youtu.be/szyPY8nbBF4?si=mww3A_y5njJcG-Xf \n・帝国少女\nhttps://youtu.be/hUaVxNUCbc4?si=zr81Xt6QaFHMgdv7\n・ヘヴンリーユー\nhttps://youtu.be/tR15E2QD63U?si=5Tm3EIHO0JXGg7yd\n\n【補足】\n解釈は自由にしていただいて構いません。\n「春らしい柔らかさ」「優しい兄としての包容感」「淡く揺らぐ不思議さ」を\n音で表現していただけると嬉しいです。\nよろしくお願いいたします！", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 380655, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "りめめり", "screen_name": "rmmr_neko21", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2013238791079620608/aR1BO1BN.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1203536171663446016/1768907671/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 5, "complete_expiration_days": 40, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 145}, {"id": 2991136, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "篠崎もちめ", "screen_name": "sisisi_sio", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1940336648891326464/Ah4EIvWu.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1568936754396405760/1751447011/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 7, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 33}, {"id": 3422201, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "桃烏龍238", "screen_name": "oolong238", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1855160121405648896/d9rxlY8A.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1280192596694855680/1731139615/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_b